1	Cracked Data Core	A remnant of the Old World's network.	The silicon is pitted and scarred, but a faint blue light still pulses within. It hums with the static of a billion forgotten conversations.	rare	{}	artifact_data_core	2026-03-01 18:12:50.541515-05
2	Void Shard	A pulsating fragment of Yaldabaoth's prison.	Cold to the touch and seemingly absorbing the light around it. To hold it is to feel the weight of infinite isolation.	epic	{}	artifact_void_shard	2026-03-01 18:12:50.541515-05
3	Membrane Leaf	Flora found only in the Lower Towers.	Transparent and veins with a bioluminescent sap. It feeds on the atmospheric pressure of the tower's depths.	uncommon	{}	artifact_membrane_leaf	2026-03-01 18:12:50.541515-05
4	Conduit's Focus	A broken lens used to channel cosmic energy.	Once part of a Drifter's apparatus. Though cracked, it still refracts the Akashic flow into visible spectrums.	rare	{}	artifact_conduit_focus	2026-03-01 18:12:50.541515-05
