hor, my partner, the literal center of my universe, sitting beside me, her hand in mine.\n\nDespite all the fuckiness, despite the wars and the loss and the realities we’d burned, this moment was perfect.\n\n"Yeah, buddy," I said, pulling him into a one-armed hug. "Absolutely. We can."	19	ai_extracted	2026-02-27 12:31:41.651453-05	2026-03-05 19:39:33.719335-05	\N	83	\N	\N
