144	The COO - Corporate Tormentor	t	A towering man of prodigious girth whose massive frame creates physical tremors through ceiling tiles with each waddle. His presence commands attention through sheer volume and obliviousness. His face is a cocktail of misplaced rage and unbridled enthusiasm for meaningless chaos. Despite his massive form, he demonstrates surprising agility in dodging accountability while expertly wielding corporate authority as a weapon of psychological torment.	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	Described as 'rare and awe-inspiring as witnessing a cow turd bathed in the shadow of a solar eclipse'; his booming laughter echoes 'like thunder'; he barks orders 'like a bullhorn on steroids'; he waddlers with 'jelly-like form' causing 'faint tremors through ceiling tiles'; his voice thunders accusations about productivity despite being source of schedule delays; he demonstrates tone-deaf motivation throughout all team-building fiascos.	"Jesus fucking wept! You people are a bunch of goddamn pussies. I always knew that developers fucking sucked. Why do I even put up with any of you? We're taking this outside. I've got an obstacle course set up, and we're brainstorming while you sweat. Move it!" Later: "Alright, slackers! Because you've all been so fucking lazy this morning, you're behind schedule, and if I don't see results, someone's getting fired!"	Unlike standard corporate middle managers, this COO is a uniquely destructive force combining physical absurdity (waddling girth, tremor-inducing footsteps) with psychological weaponization (gaslighting, termination threats, ableist ignorance). His rarity and commanding presence make him a singular threat multiplier who creates the very obstacles he then blames employees for failing to overcome. The affair with CEO Francine demonstrates his ability to corrupt power structures across the executive suite.	9	claude	claude-haiku-4-5-20251001	2026-02-27 13:07:03.395028-05	2026-03-14 18:06:15.112419-04	2	\N
