191	The Masked Informant	t	An encrypted, faceless entity operating in the darkest corners of Dark 4chan. Their identity is completely obscured, communicated only through terse, calculating messages that oscillate between temptation and threat. They project an aura of dangerous knowledge and operational security, demanding caution while issuing veiled warnings.	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	Messages state 'No proof online. Come prepared. Tomorrow. 10 PM. Watch your back.' This terse ultimatum demonstrates ruthless confidence and implies lethal capability. The phrase 'if you're trying to put one over on me' from Todd's counter-threat suggests the source knows exactly how much Todd fears being manipulated.	The Masked Informant's pivotal action is the warehouse meeting setup—luring Todd into a confined space under guise of providing evidence. Their signature quote: 'Watch your back' delivers both promise and threat simultaneously.	Unlike typical Dark 4chan anonymous users, this source demonstrates operational sophistication: refuses online proof, demands secrecy, issues warnings that imply inside knowledge of danger. They control the meeting terms entirely, forcing Todd into reactive posture. Their threat potential extends beyond digital realm into physical space—the warehouse represents their true domain.	11	claude	claude-haiku-4-5-20251001	2026-02-27 13:10:59.759386-05	2026-03-14 18:06:15.112419-04	2	\N
