4267	The Shifting Truth	t	An invisible, active force that corrupts written records of memory and history in real-time. It manifests as ink that bleeds, fades, and spontaneously appears, turning a personal journal into an instrument of psychological torment. Its presence is felt as a dizzying, nauseating sense of cognitive dissonance.	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	Some entries scratch themselves out as I watch, words fading mid-sentence like someone's erasing them in real time. Others appear spontaneously.	The spontaneous appearance of the entry: 'Star Wars prequel trilogy wins 23 Academy Awards. Jar Jar Binks spawns religious movement.'	Unlike a passive, static contradictory memory, The Shifting Truth is an active agent of change. It doesn't just present conflicting information; it actively rewrites reality on a small scale, directly in front of the observer, demonstrating its power and intent to destabilize the narrator's sanity.	366	gemini	gemini-2.5-pro	2026-02-28 18:15:39.523129-05	2026-03-14 18:06:15.112419-04	2	\N
