544	Global Grid Nexus	t	An all-encompassing networked infrastructure project of unprecedented scale, operating with absolute secrecy and seemingly unstoppable momentum. Its presence is felt everywhere—through construction barriers, material shortages, economic disruption, and diplomatic crisis—yet its true nature remains concealed.	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	Synchronized projects from Beijing to Miami; scale and secrecy confound experts; unprecedented demand for materials; rapid development of complex structures; cause of international diplomatic strain and security concerns.	Operating around the clock at all transportation hubs worldwide, the Grid consumes resources at an insatiable rate while revealing nothing of its purpose.	Unlike ordinary construction, the Global Grid Nexus operates with perfect global coordination, causing simultaneous economic, social, and geopolitical disruption. No single authority controls it; multiple resistance movements (Ghostnet, Indigenous Communities, World Leaders) target it simultaneously, yet it continues unchanged.	33	claude	claude-haiku-4-5-20251001	2026-02-27 13:50:40.783929-05	2026-03-14 18:06:15.112419-04	2	\N
