742	The Waddling COO (Corporate Destroyer)	t	A physically imposing figure whose very presence creates seismic disturbances. His voice is a guttural roar capable of shaking walls and rattling whiteboards. He radiates venomous malice and carries the aura of someone who derives pleasure from destruction. His smug grin embodies every ounce of venom he has injected into the workplace. He moves with deliberate cruelty, each step amplifying tension; his chair screams beneath his bulk.	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	Rhythmic thudding described as 'seismic disturbance caused by the waddling COO'; 'voice a guttural roar that seemed to shake the walls'; 'his sneer was the embodiment of every ounce of venom he had injected into this place'; 'leaned back in my chair (the squeals it made sounded like it was screaming in agony under his bulk) wearing a smug grin that radiated malice'; 'bellowed...spittle flew from his mouth'; 'brayed—an unhinged sound, somewhere between a laugh and a donkey's cry'	You're fired, you failure of a fuckstain. His dismissal of narrator's awards: 'We'll pack up your crap...If there's anything we find interesting, we'll send it to you. The rest? We'll toss it. No point keeping worthless shit around.' Final command: 'Leave. Now.' Each punctuated by profanity and contempt.	Unlike a generic boss figure, this COO is uniquely predatory in his method—he orchestrates not just termination but ritual humiliation. He reads a 'scripted litany' suggesting institutional premeditation, brings HR as silent witness to maximize shame, and culminates the assault by reducing the narrator's life's work to garbage. His physical presence itself becomes a weapon, causing literal seismic disturbances. His malice is both personal and systemic, embodying corporate cruelty at its most calculated and brutal.	46	claude	claude-haiku-4-5-20251001	2026-02-27 13:58:32.087628-05	2026-03-14 18:06:15.112419-04	2	\N
