4792	2884	419	ally	t	\N	\N	\N	He leaves to tell Stephen what he witnessed.	He finds Jamie crying behind the gym after she fails to summon hellfire.	A friend to Stephen and a concerned observer of Jamie's distress. He is also the subject of Morgan's 'boyfriend-girlfriend dynamics tutorial'._delta' for anything that changed. Leave delta fields null if nothing changed. - For brand-new entities: set 'is_new=true' and populate 'base_*' fields from the text. MINI-BOSS RULE: - In every scene, if any 'enemy' entities are present, you MUST designate one of them as a 'mini-boss'. - This can be an existing named enemy or a specialized variant (e.g., 'Alpha Wolf' vs 'Wolf'). - Provide detailed info in the 'mini_boss' field: 'additional_description', 'text_references', 'action_or_quote', and 'variant_differences'. LOCATION RULES: - Identify the primary location for this scene. - If new: populate 'base_*' sensory fields. If revisited: populate '*_delta' fields for changes only. SEMANTIC TAG RULES: - Tags have a category (emotion | theme | sensory) and a free-form value. - Assign tags at the beat level ('beat_number' field). - Aim for 2–4 tags per beat. Include at least one from each category across the scene. - The optional 'notes' field captures nuance the structured tag alone can't capture. ```json { "entities": [ { "canonical_name": "ኢልከሴሮድመሜብሃባኖኖራሊሊ", "entity_type": "character", "is_new": false, "role": "ally", "is_present": true, "aliases": ["Stephen", "I", "me", "my"], "emotional_state_delta": "His emotional state shifts from cautious curiosity to a deep, protective love for Jamie. He actively chooses to embrace their fragile, new reality over the warnings he's received, feeling more alive in this 'lie' than he did in his previous life." }, { "canonical_name": "Jamie", "entity_type": "character", "is_new": true, "role": "ally", "is_present": true, "base_description": "A demonic entity who is rapidly and confusingly becoming a human teenage girl. Her appearance is that of a normal sixteen-year-old, but her movements can be unnaturally graceful, and her eyes sometimes shift from warm brown to a deeper, more ancient color. Her body temperature fluctuates, hinting at her otherworldly nature.", "base_emotional_state": "Experiencing a profound identity crisis, torn between her emerging human memories and feelings, and the fading remnants of her demonic nature. She feels confusion, pain, vulnerability, and a desperate longing for normalcy and love.", "base_sounds": "Her voice is described as quiet and small when she is vulnerable, but she can also adopt a mischievous, teasing tone. She cries when overwhelmed by her transformation.", "base_smells": "Associated with the smell of homemade food (love instead of sulfur) and a personal scent of cinnamon or residual magic.", "base_abilities": "She is losing her demonic abilities, such as summoning hellfire. In their place, she is gaining or 'remembering' human skills with impossible proficiency, like cooking, intricate hair braiding, and origami." }, { "canonical_name": "TJ", "entity_type": "character", "is_new": true, "role": "ally", "is_present": true, "entry_context": "He finds Jamie crying behind the gym after she fails to summon hellfire.", "exit_reason": "He leaves to tell Stephen what he witnessed.", "relationships": "A friend to Stephen and a concerned observer of Jamie's distress. He is also the subject of Morgan's 'boyfriend-girlfriend dynamics tutorial'." }, { "canonical_name": "Morgan", "entity_type": "character", "is_new": true, "role": "ally", "is_present": false, "base_description": "A character mentioned by TJ. She is apparently giving him tutorials on romantic relationships, with him as the unwitting subject." }, { "canonical_name": "Ms. Rodriguez", "entity_type": "character", "is_new": true, "role": "neutral", "is_present": false, "base_description": "The AP Biology teacher at the high school." }, { "canonical_name": "Homemade Food", "entity_type": "object", "is_new": true, "role": "neutral", "is_present": true, "base_description": "A bag of food Jamie made for Stephen, including a perfectly cut sandwich, cookies, and soup. It represents the emergence of her human 'muscle memory' and her growing affection for Stephen.", "base_smells": "Radiates warmth and smells like a grandmother's cooking, tasting of love instead of sulfur." }, { "canonical_name": "Origami Cranes", "entity_type": "object", "is_new": true, "role": "neutral", "is_present": true, "base_description": "Perfectly folded paper cranes that Jamie creates without conscious thought. She leaves them as gifts for Stephen, symbolizing her newfound, inexplicable human skills and the patient, geometric nature of her transformation." }, { "canonical_name": "Jamie's Conflicting Memories", "entity_type": "manifestation", "is_new": true, "role": "neutral", "is_present": true, "base_description": "The internal struggle within Jamie between two sets of memories: those of a normal teenage girl and those of an ancient, powerful entity. This overlap causes her confusion and pain, but also fuels her transformation." }, { "canonical_name": "Jamie's Fading Powers", "entity_type": "manifestation", "is_new": true, "role": "neutral", "is_present": true, "base_description": "The tangible loss of Jamie's demonic abilities, exemplified by her inability to summon hellfire. This loss is a direct consequence of her growing humanity and is a source of both fear and relief for her." }, { "canonical_name": "Jamie's Desire for Normalcy", "entity_type": "manifestation", "is_new": true, "role": "neutral", "is_present": true, "base_description": "Jamie's powerful, desperate wish to live a normal human life. This desire manifests in her interest in cheerleading, prom, college, and building a future with Stephen, driving her to embrace her transformation despite the loss of her former self." }, { "canonical_name": "Demonic Entity (Jamie's Past Self)", "entity_type": "manifestation", "is_new": true, "role": "mini-boss", "is_present": true, "base_description": "The fading remnant of Jamie's original demonic nature. It represents her past identity, mission, and powers, which are in direct conflict with her emerging humanity. Its presence is seen in her reflection and felt in her moments of confusion and memory loss.", "relationships": "The antagonist force within Jamie, which she and Stephen are fighting against by embracing her humanity." }, { "canonical_name": "ኢልከሴሮድ", "entity_type": "character", "is_new": false, "role": "unknown", "is_present": false, "aliases": ["Lady Illkeserod"], "description_delta": "Mentioned in Stephen's thoughts as a source of warning about the consequences of embracing this 'false reality' with Jamie." }, { "canonical_name": "Ancient Watcher", "entity_type": "environment", "is_new": true, "role": "unknown", "is_present": true, "is_generated": true, "base_description": "An unseen, ancient presence hinted at by the wrongly moving shadows cast by streetlights. It seems to observe Stephen and Jamie's journey with a sense of approval or curiosity, representing the cosmic forces aware of their timeline-altering romance." } ], "location": { "canonical_name": "Northgate High School (Campus Grounds)", "is_new": true, "location_type": "other", "base_visual": "A quintessential American high school environment, encompassing hallways with lockers, a library filled with paper birds, a sunny courtyard for lunch, the concrete steps behind the gym, and the flagpole area out front. The setting transitions throughout a school day, grounding the supernatural events in mundane reality.", "base_auditory": "The typical sounds of a school day: the chatter of students discussing quizzes and gossip, the quiet hum of study hall, and the emotional sounds of Jamie's crying and later, her soft humming.", "base_olfactory": "The comforting smell of Jamie's homemade food contrasts with the institutional scents of the school, like old books and chalk dust.", "base_tactile": "The warmth of Jamie's hand, the feverish heat of her skin, the press of her body against Stephen's, and the texture of folded notebook paper.", "base_atmosphere": "The atmosphere is a delicate balance of teenage romance and existential dread. It shifts from sweet and hopeful to vulnerable and desperate, all under the shadow of a fragile, potentially false reality." }, "beat_entities": [ { "beat_number": 1, "entity_assignments": [ { "entity_name": "ኢልከሴሮድመሜብሃባኖኖራሊሊ", "role": "ally", "beat_context": "Receives food from Jamie and is bewildered and touched by her newfound domestic skills." }, { "entity_name": "Jamie", "role": "ally", "is_primary": true, "beat_context": "Appears at Stephen's locker, giving him homemade food and revealing she has 'muscle memory' for skills like cooking and braiding hair that she never learned." }, { "entity_name": "Homemade Food", "role": "neutral", "beat_context": "Acts as the first piece of tangible evidence of Jamie's transformation towards humanity." }, { "entity_name": "Origami Cranes", "role": "neutral", "beat_context": "Represents another manifestation of Jamie's inexplicable new skills, which she says her hands 'just know' how to do." } ] }, { "beat_number": 2, "entity_assignments": [ { "entity_name": "ኢልከሴሮድመሜብሃባኖኖራሊሊ", "role": "ally", "beat_context": "Jokes about Jamie's demonic nature, inadvertently causing her pain, and then listens as she explains her internal conflict." }, { "entity_name": "Jamie", "role": "ally", "is_primary": true, "beat_context": "Sits in Stephen's lap and jokes flirtatiously, but then reveals the pain and confusion of having two conflicting sets of memories—one human, one ancient entity." }, { "entity_name": "Jamie's Conflicting Memories", "role": "neutral", "is_primary": true, "beat_context": "Manifests as the core of Jamie's emotional distress during her conversation with Stephen." } ] }, { "beat_number": 3, "entity_assignments": [ { "entity_name": "ኢልከሴሮድመሜብሃባኖኖራሊሊ", "role": "ally", "beat_context": "Encourages Jamie's dream of trying out for cheerleading, offering support for her desire to be normal." }, { "entity_name": "Jamie", "role": "ally", "is_primary": true, "beat_context": "Expresses a desire to try out for cheerleading and live a normal college life, revealing the depth of her longing for humanity." }, { "entity_name": "Jamie's Desire for Normalcy", "role": "neutral", "is_primary": true, "beat_context": "Drives Jamie to articulate her dreams of a human future, like cheerleading and college." } ] }, { "beat_number": 4, "entity_assignments": [ { "entity_name": "TJ", "role": "ally", "beat_context": "Discovers Jamie crying behind the gym and witnesses her inability to use her powers, later reporting it to Stephen." }, { "entity_name": "Jamie", "role": "ally", "is_primary": true, "beat_context": "Breaks down in tears, unable to summon hellfire and realizing she is forgetting her demonic purpose and identity." }, { "entity_name": "Jamie's Fading Powers", "role": "neutral", "is_primary": true, "beat_context": "The direct cause of Jamie's breakdown, as she confronts the tangible loss of her former self." } ] }, { "beat_number": 5, "entity_assignments": [ { "entity_name": "ኢልከሴሮድመሜብሃባኖኖራሊሊ", "role": "ally", "is_primary": true, "beat_context": "Makes the conscious choice to embrace their reality by asking Jamie to prom and promising to face her transformation with her." }, { "entity_name": "Jamie", "role": "ally", "is_primary": true, "beat_context": "Desperately agrees to go to prom with Stephen, confessing her deep desire to be normal and build a future with him." }, { "entity_name": "Demonic Entity (Jamie's Past Self)", "role": "mini-boss", "beat_context": "Its influence is visibly fading as Jamie's reflection becomes more human and she fully commits to a future with Stephen." }, { "entity_name": "Jamie's Desire for Normalcy", "role": "neutral", "beat_context": "Culminates in her confession and her decision to choose a human life with Stephen over her demonic past." } ] } ], "semantic_tags": [ { "beat_number": 1, "category": "theme", "value": "transformation", "notes": "Jamie's transformation is shown through domestic, gentle skills, contrasting with her demonic origins." }, { "beat_number": 1, "category": "sensory", "value": "olfactory", "notes": "The smell of the food is described as smelling like 'love instead of sulfur'." }, { "beat_number": 1, "category": "emotion", "value": "hope" }, { "beat_number": 2, "category": "emotion", "value": "vulnerability", "notes": "Jamie opens up about the pain of her dual memories." }, { "beat_number": 2, "category": "theme", "value": "identity crisis" }, { "beat_number": 2, "category": "emotion", "value": "intimacy", "notes": "The physical and emotional closeness between Stephen and Jamie during a difficult conversation." }, { "beat_number": 3, "category": "emotion", "value": "longing", "notes": "Jamie's deep desire for a normal teenage experience is palpable." }, { "beat_number": 3, "category": "theme", "value": "aspiration" }, { "beat_number": 3, "category": "theme", "value": "normalcy" }, { "beat_number": 4, "category": "emotion", "value": "despair", "notes": "Jamie's breakdown upon realizing her powers and old identity are gone." }, { "beat_number": 4, "category": "theme", "value": "loss of self" }, { "beat_number": 4, "category": "sensory", "value": "visual", "notes": "The image of smeared mascara from her tears." }, { "beat_number": 5, "category": "emotion", "value": "desperation", "notes": "Both characters desperately cling to the idea of a future together." }, { "beat_number": 5, "category": "theme", "value": "commitment" }, { "beat_number": 5, "category": "sensory", "value": "gustatory", "notes": "The taste of the kiss is described as strawberry lip gloss, smoke, and honey." } ], "mini_boss": { "source_entity_name": "Jamie", "boss_name": "Demonic Entity (Jamie's Past Self)", "additional_description": "An internal, fading antagonist representing Jamie's original nature. It is characterized by immense power, a destructive mission, and non-human features like 'eyes like burning coals'. This entity is not fought physically, but emotionally, as its memories and abilities are overwritten by Jamie's growing humanity.", "text_references": "'the entity who could tear holes in reality', 'her reflection...shows two faces...something with too many teeth and eyes like burning coals', 'I was sent here to destroy you'", "action_or_quote": "I can't remember how to summon hellfire. I can't even remember the names of my superiors. I can't even remember why I'm supposed to hate you all.", "variant_differences": "This is the source of Jamie's conflict, the powerful and malevolent identity that is losing its grip. Its defeat is not through violence, but through Jamie's choice to love and be human, making its fading presence the central challenge of the scene." } } ```	gemini	gemini-2.5-pro	2026-02-28 19:07:05.433076-05	2026-02-28 19:07:05.433076-05
