e would be different.\n\nDeep down, I knew how this story would end. One of them shifted uncomfortably, eyes darting to the bottle on the table, while another forced a tight smile, their warmth already fading. They would listen politely, and then, like everyone else, they would leave.	1	17	f	2026-02-27 11:50:49.799481-05	2026-02-27 13:12:39.636819-05	normal	\N
