ere destroyed every time these devices were activated. The shadowy being and its monstrous cohorts stood vigil, reveling in the carnage and knowing that this marked a dangerous threshold being crossed - one that would ultimately lead to their ascension as cosmic horrors beyond all comprehension.\n\nThe seventh power roared with authority, its voice reverberating through the void. “The fabric of reality hangs by a thread, and these mortal creatures continue to meddle with forces beyond their comprehension.”\n\nA deep, guttural growl echoed from the sixth power as it nodded in furious agreement. “Their feeble minds cannot fathom the true consequences of their actions,” it snarled. “We have stood by for far too long, watching as they unleash chaos and destruction upon themselves and our realm.”\n\nAs the ten entities joined the conversation, a cacophony of voices filled the air, while I AM, alone in their contemplation, listed. They argued and debated, each one presenting their own twisted ideas on how to bring an end to this madness.\n\n“We should just devour them,” the fourth entity hissed, its voice laced with malice and hunger. “Let us consume their fragile bodies and souls, eradicating them from existence. We can shit out a new creation where these fuckers never existed.”\n\nIt was the tenth entity, more unknowable than the rest that shook its head, a sadistic glint in its eye. “That would be too easy,” it chuckled darkly. “Let us play with them, toy with their sanity until they are nothing but broken shells of their former selves.”\n\nThe debate raged on, each entity advocating for their own depraved method of dealing with the mortals. But amidst the chaos and bloodlust, a calm voice cut through like a knife.\n\n“Perhaps we can use their own desires against them,” it suggested, its tone chillingly serene. “Planting seeds of madness within their minds, nudging them towards self-destruction.”\n\nThe suggestion sparked an eruption of excitement among the entities. With newfound unity and purpose, they began to weave their dark powers into the human world, unleashing horrors beyond imagination.\n\n“We may not be able to erase what has already been done,” the first entity spoke solemnly. “But we can manipulate and corrupt these mortals, ensuring they will never threaten the balance of existence again.”\n\nAnd so, the ten entities descended upon the mortal world, bringing with them unimaginable terror and suffering. For the dreamer who had unwittingly unleashed these cosmic horrors, there would be no redemption. Only insanity and death awaited him, as the powers of the universe exacted their revenge.	2	127	f	2026-02-27 11:57:19.260857-05	2026-02-27 15:14:12.843937-05	normal	\N
