ke things better.”\n\nShe sighed, shaking her head. “You’re impossible, you know that? Let's head home. Dinner’s ready.”\n\nWhile I had touched the infinite, it was the love in this finite life that truly defined me.	2	165	f	2026-02-27 11:59:46.281952-05	2026-02-27 15:49:24.920784-05	normal	\N
