sly designed spaces.\n\nMy son stared, mesmerized. “Peak madness,” he said, his voice barely above a whisper.\n\n“This is the S Corp,” I replied with a grin. “Innovation in motion.”\n\nTogether, we watched as the empty void evolved before our eyes, each change bringing us closer to a space that embodied our vision. It was no longer just a headquarters—it was the heart of an empire.	3	201	f	2026-02-27 12:02:17.241235-05	2026-02-27 19:38:11.456659-05	normal	\N
