eir programmed behaviors ensuring the façade remained flawless. No one would need to every go in these building, but if they ever did, they’d operate just like any other local business would.\n\nMaintaining absolute discretion was our prime directive. With only my wife, son, and a loyal fleet of robots aware of the true scope of our activities, secrecy was achievable. Purchases and operations were carefully orchestrated through Liam and his firm to avoid drawing attention, ensuring our network remained undetected. In the span of less than a month, The S Corp had gone from simple LLC to an internation national entity, capable of operating with unprecedented efficiency on an international scale.\n\nStanding in the heart of our Houston hub, I marveled at what we’d built. The gateways seamlessly connected the world, reducing vast distances to mere moments. Once-empty properties now buzzed with covert activity, their unassuming exteriors concealing revolutionary innovation. We had created something extraordinary—an empire that transcended traditional boundaries, a testament to the boundless power of ingenuity and ambition.	4	201	f	2026-02-27 12:02:17.241235-05	2026-02-27 19:39:02.867922-05	normal	\N
