types and dismantle the notion of clones as inferior. They were as human as any of us, possessing diverse genetics, emotions, and individuality. Although their upbringing was accelerated, to the clones the perception of time in the simulation was a full 24 years. We established ethical guidelines and comprehensive support systems, granting them the freedom to choose their paths. They were not mere duplicates but celebrated members of society, integral to our shared future.	4	216	f	2026-02-27 12:02:55.673761-05	2026-02-27 19:50:15.854918-05	normal	\N
