344	85	3	The Void Within	Consumed by I AM's darkness, the narrator experiences visions of I AM's origin—a shepherd boy traumatized by death who vowed never to witness weakness again. Through compassion and understanding, the narrator absorbs I AM's power and breaks the chains binding Etheris, freeing countless souls. Yet liberation proves fleeting as the cosmos implodes without I AM's sustaining force.	Darkness swallowed me whole, its oppressive weight pressing against my very essence. The anguished cries of countless souls trapped within I AM’s insatiable hunger reverberated through my consciousness—a harrowing symphony of despair. Their torment tore at my resolve, a constant reminder of the stakes. A trillion, trillion, infinite souls of the consumed swirled all around me.\n\nAnd yet, amidst the cacophony, a single truth burned within me: this was the only path forward. To understand I AM, to confront his malevolence from within, was to arm myself with the knowledge needed to shatter the chains of this endless conflict. Even as the void threatened to consume me, I held tightly to the faint spark of hope that this sacrificial descent would ignite a brighter future.\n\nIn this realm cloaked in shadows and forgotten by time, a vision materialized before my very eyes. It was a scene of profound despair, where a young shepherd boy who lived an eternity ago in a realm long since forgotten, knelt beside his trembling flock, their bodies ravaged by the monstrous claws of a predatory beast. The air hung heavy with fear, as the boy’s innocent gaze reflected the terror that coursed through his veins.\n\nIt was in this moment, amidst vulnerability and anguish, that I AM came into existence. Born from the depths of the shepherd boy’s shattered innocence, he made an unyielding vow to never again bear witness to death or weakness. Little did he know that this solemn pledge would lead him down a treacherous path, veering further away from the true creator and plunging his being into an abyss of darkness and corruption.\n\nI delved deeper into the recesses of I AM’s true nature, an overwhelming sense of compassion washed over me. I couldn’t help but feel pity for what he had once been and what he had transformed into. The purity of the shepherd boy’s soul had been twisted into something monstrous, a malevolent force that clenched its merciless grip around the very fabric of the universe.\n\nDeep inside the unfathomable darkness that surrounded us, a glimmer of hope emerged. A flickering ember within my heart ignited, fueling my determination to seize this opportunity. With every fiber of my being, I embraced the essence of I AM, drawing his immense power into myself.\n\nOur essences merged, I became acutely aware of the existence I now bore. The full force of I AM’s power coursed through my veins, mingling with the echoes of countless souls he had consumed. It was an overwhelming sensation, threatening to consume me entirely. Yet, I stood resolute, refusing to succumb to the suffocating darkness that had defined I AM for far too long.\n\nWith a final surge of indomitable will, I shattered the chains that bound Etheris to I AM’s tyrannical reign. The very foundations of his malevolence crumbled beneath my unwavering determination, freeing the countless beings who had suffered under his merciless rule.\n\nThe impact of this cataclysmic act was immediate and far-reaching, altering the fundamental structure of the cosmos that had long been held captive in the suffocating grip of I AM’s darkness. As the veil of Etheris lifted, revealing a realm of boundless possibilities and uncharted horizons, the souls that had languished within the confines of I AM’s domain were finally set free. Their anguished cries of despair transformed into resounding songs of liberation, echoing through the newly unveiled expanse.\n\nMy sacrifice was in vain. This newfound freedom was ephemeral, destined to be fleeting. For I AM’s influence had been so deeply interwoven 