free from his clutches. On the other hand, myself and my family only existed within and because of I AM.\n\nIt was then that Madam O offered an alternative solution – there could be a way that humanity could ascend, still within the prison of Etheris, still bound by I AM’s will, but free to explore and expand within the empty cosmos devoid of other intelligent life. I would be able to be reunited with my family, but at what cost.\n\nIf I influenced enough dreamers we could seal the breach that had allowed I AM’s influence to seep into our waking world while harnessing the collective knowledge of other dreamers to manifest a new Eternal Engine technology based on fragments glimpsed in their own dreams. It might not be flawless, but it would ensure that the menace of I AM would never plague us again while we were alive.	1	126	f	2026-02-27 12:12:15.361049-05	2026-02-28 17:58:48.646912-05	normal	\N
