n... when you see TJ, don't bullshit him. He's been living in the cracks for years. He'll know if you're lying."\n\nI nodded.\n\n"And one more thing." Patrick hesitated. "The Thirteen told me something. About you. They said you've been here before. Not just this cycle. Multiple cycles. You keep coming back. Keep trying to break free."\n\n"Why?"\n\n"Because of her." Patrick's expression was unreadable. "You keep coming back because you can't leave her behind."\n\nI didn't know what to say to that.\n\nSo I just left.\n\nThe card felt heavy in my pocket as I walked back to the car. The address was scrawled on the back in Patrick's messy handwriting.\n\nOrlando. St. Michael's Outreach Center.\n\nI had a priest to find.\n\nAnd a son to save.	4	514	f	2026-02-27 12:28:53.100953-05	2026-02-28 23:00:16.411887-05	normal	\N
