lity, had shattered my perception of the world. What was real? What wasn’t? I couldn’t be sure.\n\nLying in the darkness, I felt the enormity of the risks I had taken, the dangers inherent in wielding such knowledge and power. The dream realm and the ERBs were tools of unimaginable potential, but they came with consequences I was only beginning to grasp.	0	175	f	2026-02-27 12:04:35.69225-05	2026-03-01 15:41:52.027098-05	normal	\N
