6208	2033	sensory	visual	\N	The world is described with a palpable, honey-gold light, contrasting with the 'ugly light' in the converted merchant's eyes.	gemini	gemini-2.5-pro	2026-03-01 01:11:01.276898-05	2026-03-01 01:11:01.276898-05
6209	2034	emotion	desperation	\N	The sisters are fighting a spiritual plague they cannot possibly contain, a tide they cannot hold back.	gemini	gemini-2.5-pro	2026-03-01 01:11:01.276898-05	2026-03-01 01:11:01.276898-05
6210	2034	theme	futility	\N	For every soul they save, many more are lost. Their efforts are heroic but ultimately futile against the scale of the infection.	gemini	gemini-2.5-pro	2026-03-01 01:11:01.276898-05	2026-03-01 01:11:01.276898-05
6211	2035	theme	transformation	\N	The violent, sacrificial transformation of two individuals into a single, new being born from destruction.	gemini	gemini-2.5-pro	2026-03-01 01:11:01.276898-05	2026-03-01 01:11:01.276898-05
6212	2035	emotion	despair	\N	The final moments of their world are depicted with a burning temple and a god devouring reality itself.	gemini	gemini-2.5-pro	2026-03-01 01:11:01.276898-05	2026-03-01 01:11:01.276898-05
6213	2035	sensory	auditory	\N	A 'single, fused sound' of a scream as the sisters detonate and merge.	gemini	gemini-2.5-pro	2026-03-01 01:11:01.276898-05	2026-03-01 01:11:01.276898-05
6214	2036	emotion	weariness	\N	Lady Illkeserod is described as aged by an 'infinite, bone-deep weariness' after centuries of fighting a losing battle.	gemini	gemini-2.5-pro	2026-03-01 01:11:01.276898-05	2026-03-01 01:11:01.276898-05
6215	2036	theme	salvation	\N	An unexpected, last-minute rescue arrives in the form of Benji and his portal.	gemini	gemini-2.5-pro	2026-03-01 01:11:01.276898-05	2026-03-01 01:11:01.276898-05
6216	2036	emotion	hope	\N	A stranger represents an 'impossible hope' at the absolute end of all things for this group.	gemini	gemini-2.5-pro	2026-03-01 01:11:01.276898-05	2026-03-01 01:11:01.276898-05
6217	2037	emotion	Dread	\N	The growing horror as the group follows the trail of Benji's remains.	gemini	gemini-2.5-pro	2026-03-01 01:12:06.192508-05	2026-03-01 01:12:06.192508-05
6218	2037	theme	Pursuit	\N	The scene is framed as a desperate hunt, always one step behind the predator.	gemini	gemini-2.5-pro	2026-03-01 01:12:06.192508-05	2026-03-01 01:12:06.192508-05
6219	2037	sensory	Olfactory	\N	The acrid, static-laced air of the nightmare reality.	gemini	gemini-2.5-pro	2026-03-01 01:12:06.192508-05	2026-03-01 01:12:06.192508-05
6220	2038	emotion	Horror	\N	The psychic assault of witnessing a friend and god being physically and spiritually consumed.	gemini	gemini-2.5-pro	2026-03-01 01:12:06.192508-05	2026-03-01 01:12:06.192508-05
6221	2038	theme	Helplessness	\N	The gods are forced to watch, unable to intervene as Benji is unmade.	gemini	gemini-2.5-pro	2026-03-01 01:12:06.192508-05	2026-03-01 01:12:06.192508-05
6222	2038	sensory	Auditory	\N	The wet rip of flesh and Benji's soul-vibrating scream of agony.	gemini	gemini-2.5-pro	2026-03-01 01:12:06.192508-05	2026-03-01 01:12:06.192508-05
6223	2039	emotion	Rage	\N	Lady Illkeserod's grief and fury are channeled into a single, suicidal attack.	gemini	gemini-2.5-pro	2026-03-01 01:12:06.192508-05	2026-03-01 01:12:06.192508-05
6224	2039	theme	Sacrifice	\N	Illkeserod expends a massive amount of her own power, first to attack and then to remake Benji.	gemini	gemini-2.5-pro	2026-03-01 01:12:06.192508-05	2026-03-01 01:12:06.192508-05
6225	2039	sensory	Visual	\N	Illkeserod becoming a 'comet of pure, blue-white power' and the violent knitting of flesh.	gemini	gemini-2.5-pro	2026-03-01 01:12:06.192508-05	2026-03-01 01:12:06.192508-05
6226	2040	emotion	Grief	\N	The devastating realization that the person they knew is gone forever, replaced by a hollow shell.	gemini	gemini-2.5-pro	2026-03-01 01:12:06.192508-05	2026-03-01 01:12:06.192508-05
6227	2040	theme	Loss of Self	\N	Benji's consciousness and memory are completely erased, the ultimate violation.	gemini	gemini-2.5-pro	2026-03-01 01:12:06.192508-05	2026-03-01 01:12:06.192508-05
6228	2040	theme	Revelation	\N	The horrifying truth about how to contain Yaldabaoth becomes clear through the tragedy.	gemini	gemini-2.5-pro	2026-03-01 01:12:06.192508-05	2026-03-01 01:12:06.192508-05
6229	2041	emotion	love	\N	A tragic, self-sacrificial maternal love that is being weaponized and exploited.	gemini	gemini-2.5-pro	2026-03-01 01:12:59.201311-05	2026-03-01 01:12:59.201311-05
6230	2041	theme	parasitism	\N	The creature is in a parasitic relationship, feeding on Sophia's essence while being sustained by her love.	gemini	gemini-2.5-pro	2026-03-01 01:12:59.201311-05	2026-03-01 01:12:59.201311-05
6231	2041	theme	revelation	\N	Lucifer and Lilith reveal a critical piece of lore about the enemy's nature and sustenance.	gemini	gemini-2.5-pro	2026-03-01 01:12:59.201311-05	2026-03-01 01:12:59.201311-05
6232	2041	sensory	visual	\N	The term 'luminous cloud' creates a strong visual, contrasting an image of light and beauty with the horror of its function.	gemini	gemini-2.5-pro	2026-03-01 01:12:59.201311-05	2026-03-01 01:12:59.201311-05
\.
