18	3	researching_the_pointers	Researching the Pointers	The Pointers appeared simultaneously worldwide. Every government has a file. Every file says nothing useful. You build your own theory from scratch using nothing but pattern and noise.	1	3000	10	1	2026-03-05 11:08:58.705311-05	2026-03-05 11:08:58.705311-05
