ces echoing faintly in the distance. Whatever this was, it was just for us.\n\nWe emerged into the sunlight outside the Vatican walls, the guards stopping abruptly at the exit.\n\n“Do not ever return, you have been banned,” one of them said, his voice cold. “This is for your safety.”\n\n“Our safety?” my wife repeated, incredulous. “What does that even mean? What are you not telling us?”\n\nThe guard’s expression didn’t waver. “Leave.”\n\nI considered pressing further, demanding an explanation, but something about the way the guard’s jaw tightened warned me against it. Without another word, the guards turned and marched back inside, the heavy doors closing behind them with a finality that made my stomach twist.	2	\N	4	action	present	2026-02-27 12:03:52.900871-05	2026-02-27 12:03:52.900871-05	\N	\N	0	\N	\N
