d them, the plaza buzzed with a sea of faces, captivated by the massive monitors displaying the final words of S Corp’s broadcast. “The universe awaits, and together, we shall meet it.” The closing line lingered in the air, followed by a moment of stunned silence from the crowd, a silence Todd seized.	0	\N	4	slow-burn	present	2026-02-27 12:07:04.18291-05	2026-02-27 12:07:04.18291-05	\N	\N	0	\N	\N
