lief, staunch denialism, and emotions behind their actions.”\n\n“Then we adapt,” TJ said sharply. “We dominate every battlefield, physical, ideological, digital, and spiritual. Crush their networks. Expose their leaders. If we leave any room for opposition, we risk everything.”\n\nTheir words coiled around me like thick smoke, creeping into every breath, every thought. This wasn’t just a battle of perspectives; it was a fight to keep from choking on the truth.	2	\N	3	dialogue-heavy	present	2026-02-27 12:07:56.46975-05	2026-02-27 12:07:56.46975-05	\N	\N	0	\N	\N
