ck skimmed the reports, his face darkening with every page. “This isn’t just retaliation,” he said, slamming a fist on the table. “They’re trying to dismantle us from within.”	3	\N	3	dialogue-heavy	present	2026-02-27 12:07:56.46975-05	2026-02-27 12:07:56.46975-05	\N	\N	0	\N	\N
