ne, now a slaughterhouse. Limbs strewn across the floor. Shattered IVs dripping crimson. A doctor’s head jammed inside a fucking bio-waste disposal chute.\n\nAnother feed showed the main entrance. The last of our defensive turrets had been ripped apart, their metal husks sparking feebly. Among the wreckage, bodies were impaled on rebar, twitching, coughing up blood. Some of them weren’t even dead yet.	1	\N	5	action	present	2026-02-27 12:11:27.804895-05	2026-02-27 12:11:27.804895-05	\N	\N	0	\N	\N
