enji and Lady Illkeserod wearing human suits, cruising around in a forty-foot luxury RV and parked at a retirement compound about an hour away. They were playing the part of eccentric snowbirds to provide cover and support. The thought of the Goddess of Secrets living the Winnebago life was absurd. Perfect. Exactly the kind of chaos we needed.	1	\N	2	contemplative	present	2026-02-27 12:32:56.962202-05	2026-02-27 12:32:56.962202-05	\N	\N	0	\N	\N
