ike it was never there. But the memory of its weight lingers in my palm, a phantom sensation from a future that's been deleted.\n\nPerfect. Even the comfort objects are gaslighting me now.	0	\N	2	contemplative	present	2026-02-27 12:20:16.527882-05	2026-02-27 12:20:16.527882-05	\N	\N	0	\N	\N
