id, my voice raspy from silence.\n\nShe smiled, leaning down to rest her chin on my head. "Good. The universe needs more gardeners."	0	\N	3	slow-burn	present	2026-02-27 12:32:56.962202-05	2026-02-27 12:32:56.962202-05	\N	\N	0	\N	\N
