venteen steps away, a woman in a white coat steps out of another coffee shop that wasn't there a moment ago.\n\nShe's looking directly at you.	0	\N	4	slow-burn	present	2026-02-27 12:27:12.628894-05	2026-02-27 12:27:12.628894-05	\N	\N	0	\N	\N
