rstand.\n\nYou weren't deleted by accident.\n\nYou were positioned.\n\nThe woman in white watches your realization bloom, and her smile never wavers.\n\n"There we go," she says softly. "Now we can begin."	2	\N	5	dialogue-heavy	present	2026-02-27 12:27:12.628894-05	2026-02-27 12:27:12.628894-05	\N	\N	0	\N	\N
