en but your body still knows.\n\nYou watch the Eternal Engine spin up. It's beautiful. Terrible. A machine built from dreams and mathematics and hubris. It pulls power from sources that should have stayed sleeping.\n\nThis is it, you whisper to him. This is the moment everything changes.\n\nYou're right.	0	\N	4	contemplative	flashback	2026-02-27 12:27:12.628894-05	2026-02-27 12:27:12.628894-05	\N	\N	0	\N	\N
