ze, their perfect faces stunned, glistening with blood.\n\nThen, one of them—the woman who had been "acting"—dipped her fingers into the pooling gore on the stage. She smiled. Slowly, she licked them clean.\n\nThe piping music exploded into a deafening, dissonant shriek.\n\nIt was a trigger. The performers didn't panic. They descended. They fell upon the corpse and the blood, smearing it on their faces, their chests, their partners. The scene dissolved from a "play" into a full-blown orgiastic frenzy, their ecstatic moans mixing with the music.\n\nAnd they began to chant.\n\n"I CUM!" one screamed, his eyes rolling back.\n\n"SHE COMES!" another shrieked, laughing as she painted a bloody sigil on her stomach.\n\n"HE COMES!"\n\nIt was a litany, a call-and-response of pure, blood-soaked ecstasy.\n\nThe cultists who had led us in, standing by the walls, raised their arms. Their voices joined the chant, no longer melodic, but sharp, ecstatic shrieks.\n\n"HE COMES! HE COMES! BEHOLD THE TATTERED KING!"	2	\N	5	action	present	2026-02-27 12:29:45.517676-05	2026-02-27 12:29:45.517676-05	\N	\N	0	\N	\N
