next to her. His eye and cheek unzipped in four wet, red furrows. He didn't flinch. He just turned, his own jaw now a gaping, vertical maw, and bit a chunk of flesh and yellow satin from her shoulder. He chewed.\n\nA man with a newly-formed bone-sword screamed in ecstasy as he impaled it into the of asshole of another, lifting him off the ground. Slowly the blade emerged from the victim's abdomen, slick with gore, strung with a loop of his small intestine.\n\n"What... why are they...?" Xavier stammered, blocking a wild swing from a cultist whose genitals had become a writhing, mass of tendrils.\n\n"It's chaos!" I shouted, kicking a mutated figure away. "He's an elder god! Don't try to understand it, just move! To the door!"\n\nIt was a nightmare. An "all against all" massacre set to the maddening tune of the piping in our heads. We weren't fighting. We were just surviving.	3	\N	5	action	present	2026-02-27 12:29:45.517676-05	2026-02-27 12:29:45.517676-05	\N	\N	0	\N	\N
