ce shaking with rage.\n\n"I did."\n\n"You told me Jamie didn't exist. That she was just a dream. A fantasy."\n\n"I did," she repeated, still not moving.\n\n"She exists," I said. My voice was shaking. "She's real. She's trapped inside that prison, and you told me she wasn't real."\n\n"I did," Lady Illkeserod said for the third time. "Because telling you the truth then would have broken everything."	4	\N	4	dialogue-heavy	present	2026-02-27 12:30:46.897308-05	2026-02-27 12:30:46.897308-05	\N	\N	0	\N	\N
