essed carbon. They won't shatter, won't bend. If you can extract one..."\n\nI stare at the corpse. At the exposed meat. At the thing that might be a spine running through the center mass.\n\n"You want me to dig through alien corpses for improvised weapons."\n\n"I want you to survive," Benji replies. "Look around, Stephen. You're going to need something."	2	\N	4	action	present	2026-02-27 12:31:22.457664-05	2026-02-27 12:31:22.457664-05	\N	\N	0	\N	\N
