rk trying not to go out.\n\nThe Nameless Mist coils through the dark. I can't see it but I can feel it. A presence without form. It doesn't hunt. It doesn't chase. It just is. And anything that exists in its space gets absorbed. Processed. Returned to the substrate.	0	\N	4	contemplative	present	2026-02-27 12:31:22.457664-05	2026-02-27 12:31:22.457664-05	\N	\N	0	\N	\N
