ry.\n\nThe power source wasn't just Jamie. It was us. Together. The magnetic pull between our souls. The desperate, clawing need to reunite. That infinite energy—that endless, renewable, indestructible love—is what kept Yaldabaoth contained. What held the prison together. What powered the loops for eternity.\n\nWe did this to ourselves.\n\nWe chose this. Chose to be the battery. Chose to be separated. Chose the endless, aching loneliness of infinite cycles apart because the alternative was worse.\n\nBecause if we ever did come together...\n\nI reach out.\n\nMy spark extends. A thread of consciousness stretching across the final gap.\n\nAnd she reaches back.\n\nThe moment our sparks touch, everything explodes.	1	\N	5	contemplative	present	2026-02-27 12:31:22.457664-05	2026-02-27 12:31:22.457664-05	\N	\N	0	\N	\N
