orward, catching myself on the edge of the metal bed frame with my face.\n\nA sharp, hot pain explodes from my nose, followed by the immediate, metallic taste of blood.\n\n"Fucking hell!" I groan, rolling onto my back and pinching the bridge of my nose as it starts to gush. "What's wrong with me? I mean, it's been a few weeks." I glare at the advanced tech around the room. "And if this place is so damn advanced with 'technomancy' or whatever, why can't they just magic all this away? This is ridiculous."	3	\N	3	dialogue-heavy	present	2026-02-27 12:31:41.651453-05	2026-02-27 12:31:41.651453-05	\N	\N	0	\N	\N
