d carefully. "The seed's pull is self-sustaining. It doesn't need worship or belief or stolen souls to maintain itself. Just... physics. Reality bending around mass. And since we know that Yaldabaoth in a null-magic zone can’t affect the outside of it’s prison, we know this will work."\n\nHannah leaned forward. "So we build the prison, throw Yaldabaoth inside, and seal it. Forever."\n\n"Yes."	0	\N	3	action	present	2026-02-27 12:32:10.366732-05	2026-02-27 12:32:10.366732-05	\N	\N	0	\N	\N
