hoves the last of her followers through and, with one final look of absolute hatred at the oncoming darkness, she dives through the white-gold light. Benji seizes her arm, his face a mask of grim determination, and pulls her through as the portal snaps shut behind them, leaving her entire reality to its final, dark consumption.\n\n**********	3	\N	4	contemplative	flashback	2026-02-27 12:34:17.525318-05	2026-02-27 12:34:17.525318-05	\N	\N	0	\N	\N
