 obsidian plain. We follow, a grim procession of gods, moving toward the last, desperate stand of our friend.\n\nWe arrive in a ruined clearing just below the ziggurat. And we see him.	0	\N	4	slow-burn	present	2026-02-27 12:34:17.525318-05	2026-02-27 12:34:17.525318-05	\N	\N	0	\N	\N
